ail+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2033426584/QBR_lounge_680x355.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" width="680"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table class="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Up to 15% off the base fare of selected Qantas flights</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Hi &lt; insert first name &gt;,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Further to our conversation, for a limited time, Qantas Business Rewards members are able to <b>save up to 15%</b> on the base fare (excluding taxes, fees and surcharges) of selected flights across the Qantas domestic and international network.*</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">To take advantage of this offer, log in and book via your&nbsp;<a class="seven" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/flight-search" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards account</a>&nbsp;or with your preferred Travel Agent by <b>25 March 2020</b>, for travel between 17 March and 28 February 2021.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Don't forget to add your business' ABN and the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number when you book. That way, you'll earn Qantas Points twice on every eligible flight – once for your business^ and once for the traveller~.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><span style="border-width: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/flight-sale.html"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></span></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><font face="Ciutadella, Arial, Helvetica" style="" color="#ffffff"><span style="border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/flight-sale.html" style="">Book now</a></span></font></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><span style="border-width: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclus